10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FcpBaEUom1cQ7kNvwFupqZF&_nc_oc=Ado-GGsuv7sAXFBWeWH7w0m2b5cEP7ZqhCCI4WTu_XwlgYyQA2lLfpVFAe4n48laRE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwKO-KnuQ572pJyM77Au0huW0--f_ieGjpXpTBiw2A0Ug&oe=69CFCDCC"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P_591qyOu2kQ7kNvwFJ6kPq&_nc_oc=AdpsQxOnrC9NQdA1rFCf4Jnp22kPHBV-nGiZgRLsFEhdbMCelCZqorDEfLJdpvQ-Ck0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxqkCL4LUNrHZAqhkt46covF3NNEfEUR93gA4ehd2hrmQ&oe=69CFA67C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iWRAQnr3zykQ7kNvwFFhb_-&_nc_oc=AdotnY-rcuB7b55cXzmZGtNHkvQ48oGC-TiwKTJ2xtTghwN9ef3HCwKxZtYUgM36wOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afx_8-htlu5A_V4KHA1QIZ2zT-Nv_J2Js37JUwkXJ-3OsA&oe=69CFBDAB"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore